WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.628
Curvature uses Hutchinson's trace estimator with
step 1e-3 and ten Rademacher vectors,

00:00:05.708 --> 00:00:11.336
cheap enough to run at scale.

00:00:11.416 --> 00:00:17.044
Privacy sweeps epsilon over one, ten, twenty,
thirty, forty, and fifty at delta 1e-5,

00:00:17.124 --> 00:00:22.752
averaging ten seeds.

00:00:22.832 --> 00:00:28.460
The five hundred most-memorized CIFAR100 examples
collapse under strong privacy and recover as epsilon grows.
